// Compiler-runtime helpers. Cortex-M0+ emits calls to these symbols for
// operations it cannot express directly. Keeping them as imports lets the
// RP2040 runtime use Pico's optimized implementations without linking
// non-position-independent libgcc/Pico code into each cartridge.
